\[ 24 \text{ hours/day} \times 7 \text{ days/week} = 168 \text{ hours/week} \]

Now, to find out how many hours are in 1826 weeks, you multiply the number of weeks by the number of hours per week:

\[ 1826 \text{ weeks} \times 168 \text{ hours/week} = 306,888 \text{ hours} \]

